    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311890/extras/abc8789db7ac9ed1e54041cb28252fe9.avif?t=1751811370\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Project Surfing \u2013 The Ultimate Movement Game</strong></h2><br>Slide, hop, and soar through precision-built maps in Project Surfing, a stylish, momentum-based movement game inspired by classics like surf, bhop, and kz. Compete against the clock or your friends on global leaderboards as you master the art of smooth, high-speed traversal.<br><br>Whether you're grinding for the perfect run or just vibing through chill maps with your squad, Project Surfing offers an exhilarating ride for both competitive and casual players.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc99 Love movement games? Add Project Surfing to your wishlist to stay updated and support development!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Zero-latency Singleplayer:</strong> Perfect your skills offline without interruption.<br></li><li> <strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Squad up or compete with friends via Steam lobbies.<br></li><li> <strong>Classic Modes:</strong> Bhop, Surf, KZ \u2013 all in one place.<br></li><li> <strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Climb the rankings with your best runs.<br></li><li> <strong>Custom Checkpoints:</strong> Practice efficiently or create your own flow.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlockable player skins and cosmetics.<br></li><li> Unique game modes that push the genre forward.<br></li><li> Dedicated servers for competitive consistency.<br></li><li> Special player abilities to spice up gameplay.<br></li><li> Steam Workshop support for custom maps.<br></li><li> In-game level editor to build and share your creations.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311890/extras/f0c907fc690aea5df9bcffdd8dc640df.poster.avif?t=1751811370\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311890/extras/f0c907fc690aea5df9bcffdd8dc640df.webm?t=1751811370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311890/extras/f0c907fc690aea5df9bcffdd8dc640df.mp4?t=1751811370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Project Surfing \u2013 The Ultimate Movement Game</strong></h2><br>Slide, hop, and soar through precision-built maps in Project Surfing, a stylish, momentum-based movement game inspired by classics like surf, bhop, and kz. Compete against the clock or your friends on global leaderboards as you master the art of smooth, high-speed traversal.<br><br>Whether you're grinding for the perfect run or just vibing through chill maps with your squad, Project Surfing offers an exhilarating ride for both competitive and casual players.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc99 Love movement games? Add Project Surfing to your wishlist to stay updated and support development!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Zero-latency Singleplayer:</strong> Perfect your skills offline without interruption.<br></li><li> <strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Squad up or compete with friends via Steam lobbies.<br></li><li> <strong>Classic Modes:</strong> Bhop, Surf, KZ \u2013 all in one place.<br></li><li> <strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Climb the rankings with your best runs.<br></li><li> <strong>Custom Checkpoints:</strong> Practice efficiently or create your own flow.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coming Soon:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unlockable player skins and cosmetics.<br></li><li> Unique game modes that push the genre forward.<br></li><li> Dedicated servers for competitive consistency.<br></li><li> Special player abilities to spice up gameplay.<br></li><li> Steam Workshop support for custom maps.<br></li><li> In-game level editor to build and share your creations.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311890/extras/f0c907fc690aea5df9bcffdd8dc640df.poster.avif?t=1751811370\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akama